  "interpretation": "The independently validated reply-search teacher remains stronger than routed-v6 in full duel games, but two fixed-opponent terminal-PPO runs did not transfer that advantage into the instantaneous policy. The larger run used 128 paired learner/control games and remained slightly below its frozen initialization on 128 disjoint fixed-seat maps; the confidence interval includes improvement and regression. These results reject promotion, not outcome-grounded training in general. Sparse episode credit, sampled-rollout strength, and sustained-turn representation remain open diagnoses. Neither checkpoint changes the rated or browser agent."
